prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Pass a decree of divorce dissolving the marriage between the Petitioner and the Respondent solemnised/registered on {marriage_date} at {marriage_place} under the Special Marriage Act, 1954 (Certificate No. {smr_certificate_no} dated {smr_certificate_date});
b) Award costs of this petition;
c) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall ever pray.
